 "conclusion": {
  "primary": "Pre-registered primary comparison Seg9 - Seg0 = -0.0091 (Seg0 wins 12/18, t -2.25 optimistic). The validation +0.0113 annealing gain (t 1.80, best of 5 snapshots; literal pre-registered rule = 'flat') did NOT hold on sealed OOS and slightly reversed -> treat it as selection noise / val-OOS mismatch. Annealing is not a lever.",
  "best_oos_single_model": "Un-annealed Best@475 release (Seg0): daily IC 0.1546, pooled 0.2189, ICIR 1.47, 16/18 positive, TB decile +2.68%. It is the strongest OOS generative-return model of the Beta line so far.",
  "c1_training_hurt": "C1 forecast training (Seg155) lowered OOS generative IC by ~0.038 vs its own parent Best@475 (18/18 days, t 11.2 optimistic) — consistent with val (Best@475 - Seg155 +0.019) and with 'lower WFL != higher generative IC'.",
  "vs_c2": "Gap to C2 shrinks from ~0.060 (Seg155) to ~0.022 vs C2 prod (0.1766) / ~0.025 vs C2 rank (0.1793); Seg0 beats C2 prod on 5/18 days. TB decile gap is small (+2.68% vs +2.83%/+2.84%). Seg9 vs C2: -0.031 / -0.034, 1/18 days.",
  "tail": "09-01..09-03 failure is shared by all models incl. C2 (market regime), not introduced by annealing.",
  "no_reselection": "Per pre-registration, these numbers are the final OOS read for Seg9 and Seg0; no checkpoint/decode/retraining decision should be tuned on them."
 },
 "caveats": [
  "Sealed OOS has now been read for Seg155, Seg9 and Seg0 (plus C2 earlier). It is partially spent for model-selection purposes: choosing Best@475 over Seg9/Seg155 on these numbers is a selection, so the 0.1546 is mildly optimistic as a forward estimate; any further model comparisons on this package must state this. A fresh window after 2026-09-03 is needed for an unbiased read.",
  "This kernel was a one-shot final evaluation (pre-registered); not a tuning loop.",
  "18 signal dates with overlapping 10-day label windows (~2 independent windows); paired t / sign / Wilcoxon p-values are optimistic. Seg0 - Seg9 t +2.25 should be read as 'no evidence of an annealing gain, mild evidence of a small loss'.",
  "Single decode arm (prod N5) and single seed 20260906; rank arm (T0.6/p0.9/N16) not run for Seg0/Seg9 (Seg155 rank was +0.007 over prod).",
  "Top-bottom decile excludes turnover and costs.",
  "Seg0 checkpoint carries aux heads (unused in AR decode); Seg9 is forecast-only.",
